# .claude-context — nutrition-labels repo map (token-optimized)

## Stack
- **Frontend**: React 18 + TypeScript, Vite, Zustand (recipe/saved/prefs/theme), React Query, Tailwind.
  PDF is rendered CLIENT-SIDE via `@react-pdf/renderer` (`components/label/LabelPdfDoc.tsx`).
- **Backend**: FastAPI + SQLite (read-only, FTS5), slowapi. Data-only API — NO PDF, NO Jinja2, NO WeasyPrint.
- **Infra**: docker-compose — db-init → backend(:8000) + frontend(nginx) behind Caddy TLS.

## Tree (essentials)
```
backend/app/{main,config,constants,database,models,nutrition,search}.py   # NO pdf.py
backend/data/build_db_full.py        one-time DB builder (USDA FDC CSVs)
