### Stores (Zustand)
- **`recipeStore`** — active recipe; NOT persisted. All ingredient actions key off `instanceId`.
  - Recipe content: `ingredients, portionDivisor, labelName, dimensions, instructions, variables, highlightedNutrients`.
  - Label-meta overrides (FDA fields not in USDA DB): `servingHousehold: string`, `addedSugarsG: number` (DV 50g), `transFatG: number` (no DV).
  - Actions: add/remove/updateName/updateAmount/updateUnit (preserves grams)/updatePortion (preserves grams)/moveIngredient; setPortionDivisor/setLabelName/setDimensions/setServingHousehold/setAddedSugarsG/setTransFatG/setHighlightedNutrients; step add/update/remove/move; variable add/set/update/remove; clearRecipe/loadRecipe/loadVersion/exitVersionView/setCurrentRecipeId.
  - Internal `withInstanceIds` back-fills legacy persisted rows.
- **`savedRecipesStore`** — `nl_saved_recipes` v2; max 50 recipes × 20 versions. `createRecipe/appendVersion/renameRecipe/deleteRecipe/deleteVersion`.
- **`preferencesStore`** — `nl_preferences`; `recents` (max 15) + `favorites` + `isMethodExpanded`.
- **`themeStore`** — `nl-theme`; ThemeKey: `"paper"|"overcast"|"twilight"|"midnight"`; `useActiveTheme()`, `themeVars(def, accentHex)` → CSS custom props.

